{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13751","headline":"同裴观察东湖望山歌 · 顾况","name":"同裴观察东湖望山歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浴鲜积翠栖灵异，石洞花宫横半空。\n夜光潭上明星启，风雨坛边树如洗。\n水淹徐孺宅恒乾，绳坠洪崖井无底。\n主人载酒东湖阴，遥望西山三四岑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13751.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13751","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}